        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Institutional staking expansion",
          "why": "Bitwise acquiring Chorus One, the Ethereum Foundation routing 70,000 ETH through Bitwise infrastructure, and the Lombard yield platform showed readers an asset manager crossing from passive ETF custody into active onchain yield—a structurally new risk profile."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "ETF inflow and outflow signals",
          "why": "Daily flow data—$42M inflows, first-ever outflow days, $122B industry AUM—was clicked as a real-time sentiment gauge for institutional crypto conviction."
