        },
        {
          "dimension": "Market / Liquidity",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "Bitwise itself flagged demand outstripping exchange supply in a published warning, and FTX's court-ordered liquidation of $744M in Grayscale and Bitwise shares created a known forced-seller event in a thin institutional market.",
