        },
        {
          "dimension": "Centralization",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "The Chorus One acquisition and Ethereum Foundation staking arrangement concentrate a material share of institutional ETH staking through a single asset manager, amplifying correlated slashing or operational failure risk.",
