        },
        {
          "dimension": "Slashing / Staking Penalty",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "Operating validator infrastructure for the Ethereum Foundation and institutional clients at Chorus One scale means a mis-configuration or client-diversity failure could trigger simultaneous slashing across a large validator cohort.",
